## Summary

I shipped a production-polished, native Apple SwiftUI **`DigitalTwinWidget`** surface at parity with the web source `features/dashboard/widgets/DigitalTwinWidget.tsx`, committed as `8db85ebd`.

**What was built** (10 files under `apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/`, all within the allowed `DigitalTwinWidget.*` glob, each ≤400 lines per house style):
- **Domain** — a faithful pure-Swift port of `lib/vehicleState.ts` (`buildTwinState` + door/window/turn-signal parsers + projection counts).
- **State-holder seam (P1/S8)** — `DigitalTwinModel` (`@Observable`) fed by an injected `DigitalTwinSource`; the production app wires it to the shared `VehicleStore`/`SecurityStore`/`ChargingStore` (`StateHolderModel<LoadableState>`). No HTTP in the view.
- **Telemetry seam (P1/S11)** — `viewOpened(surface:"DigitalTwinWidget")` bridging `Telemetry.track(.screenView)`.
- **View** — glass shell + a layered side-profile `VehicleTwinView` (SwiftUI `Canvas`: doors/windows/lights/lock/sentry/seat/charge, drive-in slide + wheel spin) + wrapped badge row + footer. Renders **all** states (loading/empty/error/stale/offline/content), full VoiceOver labels, Dynamic Type, Reduce-Motion.
- **i18n** — all 17 source keys (+15 native) in `DigitalTwinWidget.strings`; no English literals in code.
- **Registry** — `vehicle-twin`, 2×4 / 2×4 / 3×40 with clamp.
- **Tests** — adapter + model + registry + a11y XCTest.

**Verification (real, host-runnable — all green):**
- `swiftc -typecheck` of the 8 source files against the **real** `apps/apple` component library (macOS 15) — exit 0.
- **Executed** adapter harness — 21/21 checks passed.
- `swiftlint --strict` on the 9 files — 0 violations; `swiftformat --lint apps/apple` — 0/269; `check-placeholders` — 0.

**Deferred (documented, not faked):** the Xcode `xcodebuild build test` steps — the surface isn't yet registered into the XcodeGen app target (integration-prompt scope), `Shared.xcframework` needs a Kotlin/Native build, and macOS signing has 0 identities (ADR-012). This mirrors the sanctioned P3 "code-complete + DEFERRED Xcode gate" disposition. The log ends with `EXIT=0 / STATUS=DONE`.

